# Before timing a cloudiness threshold, check whether the limiting reagent permits it
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 Na2S2O3 0.79g
add v1 HCl 0.002mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 Na2S2O3 1.58g
add v2 HCl 0.002mol
new
add v3 water 100mL
add v3 Na2S2O3 0.395g
add v3 HCl 0.002mol
wait 24s
look v1
look v2
look v3
wait 25s
look v1
look v2
look v3
wait 64s
look v1
look v2
look v3
inspect
